# Every file reaches every platform byte for byte. Git for Windows otherwise
# rewrites line endings on checkout, and this repository carries files whose
# bytes are signed or hashed: the example manifest and its signature
# (bundles/manifests), the sandbox licence token, the issuer's public key,
# fixtures read with include_str!. A manifest with CRLF line endings fails its
# own signature, on the developer's machine and inside any zip built there
# (knowledge/26, "Windows").
* -text
